WEBVTT

00:13.500 --> 00:15.580
(East Palace)

00:15.590 --> 00:17.920
The Crown Prince died
saving His Majesty.

00:18.160 --> 00:21.830
His Majesty has ordered the Ministry
of Rites to hold a state funeral,

00:21.830 --> 00:24.320
(East Palace)
and bury him with an emperor's honors.

00:24.640 --> 00:28.190
Court is suspended for three days,
and the whole nation shall mourn.

00:28.280 --> 00:30.160
Respect this.

00:31.540 --> 00:38.460
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Prince Chen
of Daxing, Xiao Huayong)

01:16.710 --> 01:17.840
After we got married,

01:19.790 --> 01:21.400
I made you so many clothes.

01:23.200 --> 01:24.590
You didn't even get to wear them.

01:26.688 --> 01:28.200
You were always afraid of the cold.

01:28.200 --> 01:30.784
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Prince Chen
of Daxing, Xiao Huayong)

01:31.040 --> 01:32.310
Take them all with you.

01:36.680 --> 01:39.120
Noble Consort Rong has arrived!

01:58.150 --> 01:59.680
My condolences, Crown Princess.

02:01.200 --> 02:02.950
The Crown Prince died so young.

02:03.280 --> 02:05.070
His Majesty is heartbroken,

02:05.560 --> 02:07.150
and his health is deteriorating.

02:07.640 --> 02:10.590
The Empress Dowager
is also overwhelmed with grief.

02:11.470 --> 02:13.190
This massive inner palace

02:13.680 --> 02:15.310
has lost its pillar.

02:15.870 --> 02:17.240
Everyone is in a state of panic,

02:17.264 --> 02:19.088
and there are many matters to attend to.

02:23.280 --> 02:24.910
What you mean is...

02:25.520 --> 02:27.280
As for the management
of the Six Palaces...

02:27.840 --> 02:28.800
Now that

02:29.750 --> 02:31.430
you are newly widowed,

02:32.310 --> 02:34.190
it seems you can no longer
bear the burden.

02:35.630 --> 02:37.560
I shall reluctantly step in

02:38.096 --> 02:40.870
and temporarily assume this power
to bring peace to the inner palace.

02:42.150 --> 02:43.560
I ask you

02:43.616 --> 02:45.400
to hand over the seal
of the inner palace

02:45.870 --> 02:47.150
to me.

02:56.544 --> 02:58.672
The nation is in mourning,
and our family is grieving.

02:59.104 --> 03:00.520
Heaven and earth share our sorrow.

03:02.960 --> 03:04.080
Instead of

03:04.310 --> 03:05.630
comforting His Majesty

03:05.712 --> 03:07.328
and attending to the Empress Dowager,

03:07.920 --> 03:09.280
you come before his spirit tablet,

03:09.800 --> 03:12.000
before the heroic spirit
of the Crown Prince,

03:12.680 --> 03:13.910
to demand power.

03:19.190 --> 03:20.190
Crown Princess,

03:20.680 --> 03:22.000
the Crown Prince has passed away.

03:22.310 --> 03:23.840
According to ancestral rules,

03:23.960 --> 03:26.470
you should move
to a separate courtyard to rest

03:26.630 --> 03:28.520
to show the royal family's compassion.

03:29.000 --> 03:31.560
Noble Consort Rong is highly respected

03:31.630 --> 03:33.340
and can temporarily
manage palace affairs

03:33.360 --> 03:34.590
to stabilize the situation.

03:34.800 --> 03:36.310
You should know

03:36.520 --> 03:38.150
to prioritize the greater good.

03:38.240 --> 03:41.310
Please hand over the seal immediately

03:41.520 --> 03:43.120
and move out of the East Palace.

04:06.864 --> 04:08.400
The power to manage the inner palace

04:08.464 --> 04:10.256
was granted to me
by His Majesty himself.

04:11.310 --> 04:12.470
You three clan elders

04:12.630 --> 04:15.360
keep talking about ancestral rules.

04:15.800 --> 04:18.040
May I ask, the Crown Prince
died saving His Majesty,

04:18.510 --> 04:19.920
yet in this mourning hall,

04:20.510 --> 04:22.190
you do not kneel or bow

04:22.240 --> 04:23.430
to comfort his heroic spirit,

04:23.920 --> 04:26.120
instead, you force his widow
to hand over her power

04:26.120 --> 04:27.120
and move out of her home.

04:27.600 --> 04:29.120
Is this your so-called etiquette?

04:29.190 --> 04:30.270
Your so-called decency?

04:30.368 --> 04:32.400
Your so-called prioritizing
the greater good?

04:34.430 --> 04:35.720
Crown Princess,

04:36.070 --> 04:38.270
times have changed.

04:38.600 --> 04:40.040
The nation is facing difficulties.

04:40.112 --> 04:41.488
The nation is facing difficulties?

04:42.279 --> 04:43.919
So you can commit such

04:44.000 --> 04:45.510
unjust, unrighteous and shameless acts

04:45.510 --> 04:46.920
before his heroic spirit?

04:47.750 --> 04:49.000
You want power.

04:49.040 --> 04:50.160
You want the East Palace.

04:50.360 --> 04:51.000
Fine.

04:51.600 --> 04:53.190
Then I will give you an answer.

04:57.264 --> 04:58.750
The Empress Dowager's edict is here.

05:05.264 --> 05:06.830
"The Crown Prince has recently passed,

05:06.830 --> 05:08.360
and His Majesty is unwell.

05:08.430 --> 05:10.040
(Empress Dowager's Edict)
I am heartbroken and deeply grieved.

05:10.120 --> 05:11.430
Crown Princess Shen

05:11.720 --> 05:13.830
has always managed the Six Palaces
with great merit.

05:14.160 --> 05:15.680
In these extraordinary times,

05:15.792 --> 05:17.390
I specifically order the Crown Princess

05:17.390 --> 05:19.488
to temporarily manage all affairs
of the East Palace

05:19.560 --> 05:20.800
and govern the Six Palaces,

05:21.000 --> 05:22.160
to comfort His Majesty

05:22.448 --> 05:24.600
and console the Crown Prince's spirit
in heaven.

05:24.920 --> 05:26.430
Anyone who dares to cause trouble

05:26.430 --> 05:27.630
or disrupt palace rules

05:28.040 --> 05:29.120
will be severely punished."

05:32.600 --> 05:34.750
You actually requested
an edict in advance!

05:34.870 --> 05:36.000
Noble Consort Rong

05:36.870 --> 05:38.120
and the three clan elders,

05:39.070 --> 05:40.680
your words and actions just now

05:40.830 --> 05:42.040
disregarded etiquette and law.

05:42.270 --> 05:44.630
Spouting nonsense
before the Crown Prince's spirit tablet

05:44.630 --> 05:45.800
is highly disrespectful.

05:46.430 --> 05:47.190
Today,

05:47.800 --> 05:49.430
you must, before this spirit tablet,

05:50.000 --> 05:51.270
and under this imperial edict,

05:51.750 --> 05:53.270
beg forgiveness from the Crown Prince.

05:55.040 --> 05:55.600
Kneel!

05:58.160 --> 05:58.800
Kneel!

06:07.820 --> 06:10.300
(Mourning)

06:34.120 --> 06:35.070
Noble Consort Rong,

06:36.430 --> 06:37.560
tomorrow, please

06:38.270 --> 06:40.390
move to His Majesty's palace
to attend to his illness.

06:43.270 --> 06:44.160
I

06:47.310 --> 06:48.310
obey your command.

06:53.510 --> 06:55.000
Three elders, please rest assured.

06:55.480 --> 06:56.720
As long as I am here,

06:57.720 --> 06:58.750
this East Palace

06:58.870 --> 07:00.240
will be guarded by me.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.000
The sky of the East Palace

07:02.160 --> 07:02.950
will not fall.

07:03.870 --> 07:07.008
- We obey your command, Your Highness.
- We obey your command, Your Highness.

08:27.340 --> 08:28.096
=Blossoms of Power=

08:28.096 --> 08:30.940
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

08:31.020 --> 08:33.980
=Episode 33=

08:44.000 --> 08:45.120
Greetings, Your Highness.

08:45.960 --> 08:46.670
You may rise.

08:49.240 --> 08:50.030
Yunhuai,

08:50.750 --> 08:53.200
I heard you refused
to inherit the noble title.

08:54.910 --> 08:55.480
Yes.

08:58.240 --> 09:00.720
I will never forget
the Crown Prince's kindness

09:01.312 --> 09:02.896
to my mother for the rest of my life.

09:04.360 --> 09:05.870
But I have grown tired

09:06.030 --> 09:07.750
of the filth within these noble manors.

09:08.048 --> 09:10.150
Furthermore, I lack the talent
to govern the country.

09:11.000 --> 09:11.870
Inheriting the title

09:12.256 --> 09:14.576
would just be holding a position
without doing any real work.

09:14.928 --> 09:15.840
For the rest of my life,

09:15.856 --> 09:17.910
I wish to find solace
in the mountains and wilderness,

09:18.030 --> 09:20.440
compile medical prescriptions
to save lives,

09:21.000 --> 09:22.720
and treat more patients.

09:23.320 --> 09:24.120
This way, I won't

09:24.840 --> 09:27.480
let down the good intentions
of both the Crown Prince and you.

09:28.840 --> 09:29.960
The rest of your life is long.

09:30.550 --> 09:31.840
I respect your wishes.

09:33.030 --> 09:34.390
But if one day,

09:34.550 --> 09:35.720
you change your mind,

09:36.270 --> 09:37.550
you can come find me anytime.

09:42.790 --> 09:43.840
Thank you, Your Highness.

09:48.630 --> 09:50.600
The Crown Prince once said

09:51.440 --> 09:53.120
that what he couldn't let go of the most

09:53.840 --> 09:55.670
were you, Crown Princess, and his child.

09:56.550 --> 09:58.120
If you ever need anything in the future,

09:58.688 --> 10:01.120
you can send a message to me
using the Crown Prince's method.

10:01.720 --> 10:03.750
I am willing to do anything
for you and your child

10:03.776 --> 10:05.240
even if it means sacrificing my life.

10:06.240 --> 10:07.200
I will not hesitate.

10:25.660 --> 10:29.020
(Sixian Hall, Mourning)

11:05.500 --> 11:08.380
(Cultivate Virtue
and Practice Righteousness)

11:12.390 --> 11:13.750
Greetings, Your Highness.

11:21.940 --> 11:22.860
(Submitted to the Crown Princess
by the Imperial Household Department)

11:23.000 --> 11:24.030
Reporting to Your Highness,

11:24.040 --> 11:26.400
these are the reports submitted
by the General Palace Service,

11:26.416 --> 11:28.830
detailing the monthly allowance
withdrawals for the Six Palaces.

11:28.840 --> 11:31.600
Prefect of the Imperial Palace Chambers
submitted the list of recruited servants

11:31.600 --> 11:32.850
and the petition for dismissals.

11:32.910 --> 11:35.550
The Imperial Household Department
reported on the repair of utensils.

11:35.560 --> 11:37.320
This is submitted
by the Imperial Wardrobe Service,

11:37.320 --> 11:40.050
detailing the materials for winter
clothes for masters of the Six Palaces

11:40.064 --> 11:41.200
and various ranks of palace servants.

11:41.248 --> 11:42.440
Officer of Adornments submitted

11:42.440 --> 11:44.960
the styles of crowns and jewelry
for the year-end court greetings.

11:45.000 --> 11:47.720
And the Imperial Household Department's
report on cleaning the regalia.

11:52.380 --> 11:58.220
(Cultivate Virtue
and Practice Righteousness)

12:35.630 --> 12:37.870
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

12:39.200 --> 12:41.450
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

12:42.770 --> 12:48.050
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

12:49.980 --> 12:52.920
♪I've hidden so many words♪

12:53.540 --> 12:56.340
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

12:57.210 --> 13:04.180
♪So never uncover♪

13:04.370 --> 13:06.730
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

13:07.860 --> 13:10.590
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

13:11.550 --> 13:16.890
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

13:18.650 --> 13:21.470
♪Every answer I gave♪

13:22.270 --> 13:25.120
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

13:25.910 --> 13:29.280
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

13:29.540 --> 13:32.850
♪How hard it truly was?♪

13:35.820 --> 13:39.260
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

13:40.250 --> 13:42.580
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

13:43.850 --> 13:49.610
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

13:51.020 --> 13:54.150
♪It's a shame I never could♪

13:54.600 --> 13:57.610
♪Give you a moon in return♪

13:57.720 --> 14:04.360
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

14:04.360 --> 14:08.030
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

14:08.900 --> 14:11.660
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

14:12.100 --> 14:15.230
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

14:15.670 --> 14:21.620
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

14:23.020 --> 14:26.570
♪You'll never♪

14:26.850 --> 14:36.100
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

14:55.440 --> 14:57.970
♪Wind that misses the grasp♪

14:58.960 --> 15:01.200
♪Light that ignites at a single touch♪

15:01.200 --> 15:02.620
(Clarity and Serenity)

15:02.620 --> 15:07.940
♪A person can find strength
time and again♪

15:09.780 --> 15:12.650
♪Our past♪

15:13.280 --> 15:16.050
♪Has been full of ups and downs
along the way♪

15:16.860 --> 15:18.520
♪Admitting my confusion♪

15:18.520 --> 15:20.520
♪Just like your regret♪

15:20.520 --> 15:23.930
♪How hard can it be?♪

15:26.720 --> 15:30.390
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

15:31.250 --> 15:33.850
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

15:34.440 --> 15:35.600
But this bell is so loud.

15:36.000 --> 15:37.150
I can't sleep either.

15:38.200 --> 15:39.270
As long as you don't move,

15:39.270 --> 15:40.440
the bell won't ring.

15:41.940 --> 15:45.190
♪You understand my pride♪

15:45.490 --> 15:48.560
♪It is actually just like yours♪

15:48.680 --> 15:52.480
♪So please try your best
to be open first♪

15:52.510 --> 15:53.840
Just assume I did it on purpose.

15:55.290 --> 15:59.470
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

15:59.910 --> 16:02.950
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

16:05.200 --> 16:06.000
Your Highness,

16:07.270 --> 16:08.440
when you wake up,

16:09.360 --> 16:11.600
there's something I must tell you.

16:12.630 --> 16:13.750
In my heart...

16:14.240 --> 16:17.420
♪It is actually just like yours♪

16:19.600 --> 16:20.790
You are the best.

16:24.020 --> 16:28.280
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

16:28.570 --> 16:31.710
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

16:31.710 --> 16:35.130
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

16:35.360 --> 16:41.970
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

16:42.970 --> 16:48.540
♪The flustered mortal world♪

16:49.960 --> 16:53.170
♪Your eyes♪

17:34.960 --> 17:35.790
Your Highness,

17:36.080 --> 17:38.470
the Fifth Prince comes to seek
an audience with you every day.

17:38.480 --> 17:40.064
He says if he doesn't see you this time,

17:40.270 --> 17:41.160
he won't leave.

17:42.510 --> 17:43.200
I won't see him.

17:48.350 --> 17:49.240
Why not?

17:57.400 --> 17:59.160
I am the Crown Prince's widow.

18:00.310 --> 18:02.550
Meeting a man privately
during the mourning period

18:03.000 --> 18:04.030
is inappropriate.

18:06.640 --> 18:07.880
You have been

18:08.200 --> 18:09.480
keeping to yourself lately.

18:09.856 --> 18:12.144
After the chaos at the
Empress Dowager's birthday banquet,

18:12.680 --> 18:14.030
my father fell ill.

18:17.070 --> 18:18.400
I have become the Regent,

18:19.590 --> 18:21.440
handling state affairs on his behalf.

18:23.830 --> 18:25.160
Congratulations, Your Highness.

18:46.576 --> 18:48.800
Your Highness,
please do not be disrespectful.

18:53.000 --> 18:53.790
You may leave.

18:54.880 --> 18:55.790
Your Highness.

18:56.110 --> 18:56.720
Leave us.

19:06.790 --> 19:07.830
What he could do,

19:09.830 --> 19:10.790
I can do as well.

19:18.720 --> 19:20.400
This was given to me by my late husband.

19:21.480 --> 19:22.110
Others

19:23.110 --> 19:24.030
must not touch it.

19:39.424 --> 19:41.300
My mother made things difficult
for you again,

19:41.350 --> 19:41.960
didn't she?

19:43.240 --> 19:44.920
I won't let these trivial matters

19:44.920 --> 19:46.288
cause trouble with my elders.

19:47.160 --> 19:48.750
You don't need to worry.

19:49.640 --> 19:51.160
The way you speak now

19:52.960 --> 19:54.440
is exactly like the Crown Prince.

19:55.720 --> 19:57.400
We were husband and wife, one entity,

19:57.696 --> 19:59.360
closely connected to each other.

20:04.000 --> 20:05.000
It's all his fault

20:06.000 --> 20:09.750
for leaving you in such a dilemma.

20:13.200 --> 20:14.350
He has passed away.

20:15.720 --> 20:16.350
People...

20:18.240 --> 20:19.550
must always look forward.

20:24.070 --> 20:26.070
I offer the same words to you.

20:35.480 --> 20:36.920
Please conduct yourself with dignity.

20:41.750 --> 20:43.350
I know you have great ambitions,

20:44.288 --> 20:46.544
but the palace is full
of hidden dangers right now.

20:47.070 --> 20:47.960
How can you alone

20:48.030 --> 20:49.680
deal with the struggles in the court?

20:50.590 --> 20:51.590
Trust me this once.

20:53.550 --> 20:54.920
Let me protect you.

20:55.960 --> 20:57.000
No matter what situation

20:57.240 --> 20:58.790
I will face in the future,

21:00.200 --> 21:01.590
I can face it myself.

21:33.070 --> 21:35.590
Your Highness, these are prepared
according to your orders

21:35.720 --> 21:38.640
for the Crown Princess's child.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.200
You did well.

22:00.510 --> 22:01.240
You may leave.

22:02.352 --> 22:03.160
Yes, Your Highness.

22:41.310 --> 22:43.750
Prince Xin has entered the palace again?

22:45.310 --> 22:46.480
Lately,

22:46.480 --> 22:48.550
Prince Xin is in the palace every day.

22:48.830 --> 22:50.030
Rumor has it

22:50.440 --> 22:52.480
that it's all for the Crown Princess.

23:00.240 --> 23:01.400
Li Simeng,

23:01.480 --> 23:03.720
at age two, could speak of his past life

23:04.110 --> 23:05.110
in great detail.

23:05.240 --> 23:06.880
At age six, he went to Mount Li,

23:07.550 --> 23:10.750
and met an old lady named Feng
on Qifan Street.

23:11.640 --> 23:13.440
He cried and threw himself
into her arms,

23:14.030 --> 23:16.590
saying Feng was his mother
in his past life.

23:17.270 --> 23:20.030
Everything he said
about his past life was verified.

23:21.350 --> 23:22.270
(Could it be)

23:22.920 --> 23:24.640
(that Shen Xihe...)

23:39.310 --> 23:40.440
Greetings, Your Highness.

23:42.590 --> 23:43.680
Why do you wish

23:44.070 --> 23:45.110
to see me?

23:45.744 --> 23:47.400
The Crown Prince,
to protect His Majesty,

23:47.480 --> 23:48.590
unfortunately passed away.

23:49.000 --> 23:50.510
You have been managing the funeral,

23:50.680 --> 23:51.790
grieving day and night.

23:52.240 --> 23:53.680
I have been worried about you

23:54.550 --> 23:55.920
and wish to share your burden.

23:57.440 --> 23:59.240
How can you even say such things?

24:00.310 --> 24:01.680
I deeply regret my past actions.

24:01.680 --> 24:03.070
I genuinely care about you.

24:05.030 --> 24:06.000
Because

24:06.880 --> 24:09.000
you are my only remaining family
in this world.

24:13.590 --> 24:15.480
What nonsense are you spouting now?

24:15.680 --> 24:17.200
I have consulted historical records.

24:17.350 --> 24:18.270
Throughout history,

24:18.270 --> 24:20.200
such shocking and bizarre events
actually exist,

24:20.200 --> 24:21.240
and they are not uncommon.

24:21.520 --> 24:23.184
I have no choice but to believe it.

24:25.510 --> 24:26.240
Qingzhi,

24:26.880 --> 24:28.510
the Gu family suffered a massacre.

24:29.510 --> 24:31.110
I was truly left all alone and helpless.

24:31.216 --> 24:32.310
In order to protect myself,

24:32.336 --> 24:34.470
the Empress Dowager promised me
the position of Princess Consort Ning.

24:34.480 --> 24:35.720
To not let our father down,

24:36.070 --> 24:37.510
and the entire Gu family,

24:39.440 --> 24:41.550
even if I had to resort
to any means and be despised,

24:41.550 --> 24:42.830
I had to survive.

24:45.504 --> 24:47.000
What exactly are you trying to do?

24:54.960 --> 24:56.640
This is our mother's only relic.

24:57.070 --> 24:58.270
You must recognize it.

24:59.030 --> 25:00.590
We were not born of the same mother,

25:01.000 --> 25:02.960
but Mother treated me as her own.

25:03.590 --> 25:04.400
Now,

25:04.550 --> 25:06.200
I am returning this golden lock to you.

25:06.440 --> 25:07.590
I can finally be at peace.

25:36.510 --> 25:37.750
You tampered with

25:38.640 --> 25:39.680
this golden lock.

25:41.400 --> 25:43.000
You hid something dirty inside.

25:43.488 --> 25:45.472
There is a rare poison
from the Western Regions,

25:46.320 --> 25:48.040
modified from an incense formula.

25:48.830 --> 25:50.480
Once it touches the skin,

25:50.790 --> 25:52.110
it corrodes the internal organs.

25:52.400 --> 25:53.440
There is no cure.

25:54.160 --> 25:55.310
You hid that poisonous powder

25:55.720 --> 25:57.240
inside this golden lock.

25:58.070 --> 25:59.880
You are trying to kill me.

26:01.270 --> 26:01.960
Qingzhi.

26:03.240 --> 26:04.880
Your tears come so easily.

26:06.030 --> 26:07.030
It's just a pity

26:07.360 --> 26:08.640
that your acting is terrible.

26:12.350 --> 26:13.160
Qingzhi,

26:13.640 --> 26:15.590
why do you wrong my sincere intentions?

26:16.550 --> 26:17.720
I am not your sister.

26:18.510 --> 26:20.270
Even the most heinous villains

26:20.960 --> 26:22.310
have a fleeting moment

26:22.750 --> 26:24.240
of conscience.

26:25.350 --> 26:26.550
But your coldness

26:27.200 --> 26:28.640
has chilled you to the bone.

26:29.440 --> 26:31.030
A person as vicious as you

26:31.480 --> 26:32.790
is truly rare.

26:33.590 --> 26:34.270
Tell me,

26:35.790 --> 26:37.350
who instigated you to come to me?

26:40.550 --> 26:41.350
No one.

26:43.240 --> 26:44.790
I just hate you to the core.

26:47.030 --> 26:48.830
A helpless orphan like you...

26:50.200 --> 26:51.480
Where did you get the nerve

26:51.680 --> 26:53.070
to confront the East Palace?

26:56.830 --> 26:58.750
Whether you are Shen Xihe

26:58.750 --> 27:00.110
or Gu Qingzhi,

27:01.550 --> 27:04.200
seeing this inherently noble
and composed face of yours,

27:04.550 --> 27:06.030
I just want to tear it to pieces!

27:07.960 --> 27:09.400
Since you are so smart,

27:10.400 --> 27:12.510
go find your answers in the underworld!

27:27.310 --> 27:29.030
What can you do to me?

27:36.480 --> 27:37.350
Whether you live

27:39.000 --> 27:39.790
or die

27:42.590 --> 27:44.110
is entirely up to you.

28:16.030 --> 28:17.000
Gu Qingshu

28:17.310 --> 28:18.750
attempted to murder the royal heir.

28:19.440 --> 28:20.880
Her crime is punishable by death.

28:39.960 --> 28:40.640
Mo Yu,

28:43.240 --> 28:44.350
go invite His Majesty.

28:46.270 --> 28:47.480
I will wait here.

28:49.136 --> 28:50.064
Yes, Your Highness.

29:25.240 --> 29:26.310
Greetings, Your Majesty.

29:26.960 --> 29:28.000
Greetings, Empress Dowager.

29:29.400 --> 29:30.350
Xihe,

29:30.790 --> 29:32.440
what exactly happened?

29:32.464 --> 29:34.090
Please allow me to explain,
Your Majesty.

29:34.350 --> 29:35.790
Since the Crown Prince passed away,

29:36.496 --> 29:38.680
I have been living in seclusion
in the East Palace.

29:39.400 --> 29:42.160
Second Young Lady Gu said she wanted
to bring me a pregnancy tonic.

29:42.680 --> 29:44.110
Thinking she had good intentions,

29:44.240 --> 29:45.400
I agreed to see her.

29:46.000 --> 29:47.030
But who would have thought

29:47.030 --> 29:49.400
she would give me a golden lock
hiding poisonous powder?

29:50.160 --> 29:51.440
After her plot was exposed,

29:51.440 --> 29:52.896
she drew a dagger to assassinate me.

29:53.270 --> 29:55.200
Ultimately, she fell into her own trap

29:55.248 --> 29:56.550
and died from her own poison.

29:57.856 --> 29:59.720
I have never had any intention
to harm anyone.

30:01.550 --> 30:02.160
Your Majesty,

30:02.680 --> 30:04.270
Second Young Lady Gu's personal maid

30:04.336 --> 30:06.096
is requesting an audience
outside the hall.

30:07.350 --> 30:08.070
Your Majesty,

30:08.750 --> 30:09.920
coming to report at this time,

30:10.510 --> 30:12.240
she must know some inside information.

30:13.550 --> 30:14.310
Summon her.

30:14.896 --> 30:15.984
Yes, Your Majesty.

30:19.510 --> 30:20.880
I beg Your Majesty for justice.

30:21.070 --> 30:22.160
My lady

30:22.160 --> 30:23.880
was murdered by the Crown Princess!

30:24.070 --> 30:25.920
She was murdered by the Crown Princess!

30:26.510 --> 30:27.960
Did you see it with your own eyes?

30:29.830 --> 30:30.680
Insolent!

30:32.310 --> 30:33.880
Since you didn't see it,

30:34.960 --> 30:36.160
how do you know?

30:39.664 --> 30:42.640
When the Fourth Prince staged a coup and
attempted to assassinate Your Majesty,

30:42.704 --> 30:44.816
the East Palace knew
about it in advance.

30:44.830 --> 30:46.590
Yet the Crown Prince concealed it

30:46.750 --> 30:48.240
and let it happen.

30:48.720 --> 30:49.960
My lady

30:49.960 --> 30:51.960
found out about this by accident.

30:52.070 --> 30:53.808
Knowing she was in grave danger,

30:53.810 --> 30:56.240
before entering the palace
to see the Crown Princess this time,

30:56.240 --> 30:57.680
she wrote a letter with her own hand

30:57.750 --> 30:58.680
and instructed me

30:58.720 --> 31:00.350
that if she didn't return
for a long time,

31:00.440 --> 31:01.720
I should present this letter

31:01.720 --> 31:03.030
to Your Majesty.

31:20.016 --> 31:22.400
The assassination attempt that day
was extremely perilous.

31:23.110 --> 31:25.000
If the Crown Prince truly concealed it,

31:27.550 --> 31:29.400
even though he died saving Your Majesty,

31:29.680 --> 31:32.310
the East Palace gained endless benefits.

31:33.550 --> 31:34.680
Thinking about it this way,

31:35.440 --> 31:36.590
if it was

31:37.350 --> 31:39.200
a meticulously calculated scheme,

31:40.200 --> 31:41.830
it's not entirely impossible.

31:54.070 --> 31:55.680
Based on just a single letter,

31:56.144 --> 31:58.550
you dare to falsely accuse
the Crown Prince with empty words?

31:58.920 --> 31:59.680
Insolent!

32:00.608 --> 32:02.944
How dare you behave so recklessly
before Your Majesty?

32:05.760 --> 32:08.160
The Crown Prince sacrificed his life
to protect the country.

32:08.944 --> 32:11.200
Yet you, Noble Consort Rong,
right here in the hall,

32:11.400 --> 32:12.880
make such malicious speculations,

32:13.030 --> 32:14.400
openly slandering a heroic spirit.

32:14.880 --> 32:16.200
As the Crown Princess,

32:16.240 --> 32:17.880
I must protect my husband's reputation.

32:18.000 --> 32:19.536
How can I tolerate this any longer?

32:21.440 --> 32:22.750
I beg Your Majesty for justice

32:23.310 --> 32:24.640
to clear the East Palace's name.

32:27.590 --> 32:28.240
Your Majesty,

32:29.110 --> 32:31.200
I had no intention
of slandering the Crown Prince.

32:31.920 --> 32:32.590
I...

32:33.590 --> 32:35.510
will never allow anyone

32:36.240 --> 32:37.790
to speak nonsense

32:38.480 --> 32:40.440
and tarnish
the Crown Prince's reputation.

32:40.720 --> 32:41.880
Anyone who violates this

32:41.952 --> 32:42.720
will be executed!

32:46.590 --> 32:47.550
Today,

32:47.790 --> 32:50.640
Gu Qingshu ending up like this

32:51.110 --> 32:53.000
is entirely her own fault.

33:02.780 --> 33:07.340
(Prince Xin's Manor)

33:20.200 --> 33:21.880
Your Highness, you invited me here,

33:22.240 --> 33:23.830
is it about Gu Qingshu?

33:24.680 --> 33:25.240
No.

33:26.384 --> 33:28.448
I thought you were going
to hold me accountable.

33:29.110 --> 33:29.880
After all,

33:30.032 --> 33:31.480
she has always been under your care.

33:32.070 --> 33:33.000
I only care about you.

33:35.680 --> 33:37.270
Since you have nothing else to discuss,

33:38.160 --> 33:39.310
I'll take my leave.

33:42.200 --> 33:42.880
Come with me.

34:07.510 --> 34:08.360
Do you remember?

34:11.320 --> 34:13.110
These are all the poems you left behind.

34:16.590 --> 34:18.280
When you were still an unmarried maiden,

34:20.150 --> 34:21.590
every time you released a new work,

34:22.176 --> 34:24.110
all the young scholars
and ladies in the city

34:24.960 --> 34:26.400
would scramble to read it.

34:29.440 --> 34:31.280
Among your many admirers,

34:34.630 --> 34:36.110
I was the most passionate one.

34:37.550 --> 34:38.920
What exactly do you want?

34:53.056 --> 34:55.400
Supervising the execution
of the entire Gu family back then

34:58.800 --> 34:59.920
was my fault.

35:02.960 --> 35:04.670
It was me who failed to protect you

35:05.840 --> 35:07.030
and the Gu family.

35:10.070 --> 35:11.480
Now, I want

35:13.760 --> 35:15.760
to spend the rest of my life
making up for it.

35:18.800 --> 35:19.510
Qingqing,

35:23.960 --> 35:25.230
don't leave me behind again.

35:31.190 --> 35:32.280
Your Highness,

35:34.710 --> 35:36.190
stop deceiving yourself.

35:37.440 --> 35:38.440
You and I

35:38.800 --> 35:40.070
are strangers to begin with.

35:40.510 --> 35:41.190
No.

35:42.760 --> 35:45.280
From beginning to end, and from now on,

35:46.760 --> 35:48.440
I have always been your husband.

35:48.880 --> 35:49.960
I only have

35:50.440 --> 35:51.400
one husband,

35:52.710 --> 35:53.880
and that is Xiao Huayong.

35:57.190 --> 35:58.320
In this world,

35:59.000 --> 36:00.880
no one can compare to him.

36:09.710 --> 36:10.960
I also once thought

36:11.590 --> 36:13.360
you were born cold and heartless.

36:14.800 --> 36:16.880
I didn't expect your heart
could be warmed.

36:17.960 --> 36:18.880
But that person

36:19.150 --> 36:19.880
wasn't you.

36:24.800 --> 36:25.710
Tell me,

36:26.070 --> 36:27.590
why is it Xiao Huayong,

36:27.590 --> 36:28.670
and not me?

36:36.670 --> 36:37.800
Your so-called love

36:38.760 --> 36:40.110
is in the name of protection,

36:40.230 --> 36:41.670
but in reality, it's just possession.

36:42.800 --> 36:43.840
But the Crown Prince

36:45.030 --> 36:46.400
risked his life

36:47.070 --> 36:48.440
to help me become

36:48.960 --> 36:50.480
the master of my own fate.

37:15.300 --> 37:18.010
♪Time is like a river flowing backward♪

37:18.010 --> 37:20.640
♪The story is sketched anew♪

37:20.640 --> 37:24.280
♪The moonlight is sewn together
by the dusk♪

37:25.730 --> 37:28.500
♪The tide engulfs the lines on my palm♪

37:28.500 --> 37:31.230
♪Pushing me to converge with you♪

37:31.230 --> 37:35.710
♪Sifting for joy in a sea of sorrow♪

37:36.350 --> 37:38.990
♪I step onto this winding path♪

37:38.990 --> 37:41.330
♪What was swept away?♪

37:41.520 --> 37:45.690
♪Joy and sorrow show no emotion♪

37:46.730 --> 37:49.300
♪The clouds twist into a vortex♪

37:49.300 --> 37:52.050
♪Reaching out to touch you♪

37:52.050 --> 37:56.830
♪Only to find it's just a bubble♪

37:58.090 --> 38:00.360
♪Scene after scene of yesterday♪

38:00.360 --> 38:03.230
♪Lies between the sky and the water♪

38:03.230 --> 38:05.600
♪The stars are sinking♪

38:05.600 --> 38:08.600
♪Like a sunken vow♪

38:09.090 --> 38:11.770
♪You drifted away alone♪

38:12.400 --> 38:16.840
♪Without a single word of goodbye♪

38:17.710 --> 38:20.320
♪Leaving no room to turn back♪

38:20.320 --> 38:24.590
♪I can only stay there forever♪

38:24.590 --> 38:29.820
♪In the coming years, I'll always
remember that year, my graceful lover♪

38:30.020 --> 38:32.230
♪Love hangs on the crest of the waves♪

38:32.660 --> 38:36.630
♪Waiting for regret to swallow me up♪

38:57.670 --> 38:59.030
What exactly are you trying to do?

38:59.568 --> 39:02.240
You haven't eaten or drunk anything
for three whole days!

39:03.000 --> 39:04.230
Do you really want to die?

39:09.400 --> 39:10.280
Say something!

39:11.280 --> 39:12.000
Speak!

39:12.710 --> 39:13.590
Speak!

39:27.190 --> 39:28.550
How could I bear to die?

39:46.320 --> 39:48.230
If even the gods refuse to save me,

39:53.880 --> 39:55.440
then I'll save myself.

40:33.280 --> 40:34.030
Your Highness,

40:34.510 --> 40:36.630
His Majesty is currently in poor health.

40:36.672 --> 40:38.480
You are the appointed regent.

40:38.512 --> 40:40.150
In terms of civil and military prowess,

40:40.160 --> 40:42.230
who among the princes can surpass you?

40:42.710 --> 40:44.590
If you rally your supporters now,

40:44.590 --> 40:46.440
the throne will be yours for the taking.

40:46.496 --> 40:47.760
If you hesitate any longer,

40:47.770 --> 40:49.950
and wait until the Crown Princess
gives birth to an heir,

40:49.960 --> 40:52.280
even with your monumental talents,

40:52.280 --> 40:54.760
you will only be paving the way
for others.

40:55.030 --> 40:57.320
At most, you'll be appointed
to the cabinet

40:57.920 --> 40:59.800
to assist a young ruler.

41:00.400 --> 41:01.070
Your Highness,

41:01.190 --> 41:03.110
you must also consider the Rong family.

41:03.190 --> 41:04.510
When the Duke of Ying was alive,

41:04.510 --> 41:06.480
how illustrious our Rong family was.

41:06.560 --> 41:09.168
Noble Consort Rong was also
the most favored in the inner palace.

41:09.230 --> 41:11.400
But now that the Duke of Ying
has passed away,

41:11.400 --> 41:13.488
Noble Consort Rong no longer
enjoys her former favor.

41:13.490 --> 41:15.540
You bear the responsibility
of protecting our family

41:15.550 --> 41:16.880
and restoring our family's honor.

41:16.944 --> 41:19.070
If Shen Xihe's status rises
because of her child,

41:19.070 --> 41:21.030
the Northwest Army will dominate alone.

41:21.320 --> 41:22.150
When that time comes,

41:22.150 --> 41:23.030
in the imperial court,

41:23.030 --> 41:25.630
there will be no place
for our Rong family.

41:27.480 --> 41:28.110
Your Highness,

41:28.480 --> 41:29.400
forgive my bluntness,

41:30.112 --> 41:31.480
but things have come to a point

41:31.550 --> 41:32.800
where there is no turning back.

41:32.896 --> 41:34.710
Although the Crown Princess is
but a woman,

41:35.110 --> 41:36.550
her intellect and methods

41:36.630 --> 41:37.880
are well known to everyone here.

41:38.280 --> 41:39.070
In my opinion,

41:39.230 --> 41:40.880
we might as well go all the way

41:41.110 --> 41:42.280
to kill Shen Xihe

41:42.368 --> 41:43.990
and eliminate the threat
once and for all.

41:44.030 --> 41:44.670
Your Highness,

41:45.000 --> 41:46.590
we have already devised a sound plan.

41:46.710 --> 41:48.440
When the time comes, Shen Xihe's death

41:48.440 --> 41:50.000
will be blamed on palace intrigue.

41:50.190 --> 41:51.230
Even if they investigate,

41:51.230 --> 41:54.000
they will only find
an insignificant scapegoat.

41:54.496 --> 41:57.570
- For Your Highness, we are all willing
- For Your Highness, we are all willing

41:57.584 --> 42:00.110
- to risk our lives!
- to risk our lives!

42:04.230 --> 42:04.960
Your Highness,

42:05.030 --> 42:06.230
time waits for no one.

42:06.272 --> 42:08.710
The rise and fall, the honor
and disgrace of the Rong family,

42:08.710 --> 42:11.510
all depend on your decision.

42:15.480 --> 42:16.110
Your Highness,

42:16.630 --> 42:18.150
I am willing to be that sword.

42:18.880 --> 42:20.880
Once it's done, all the blame

42:21.030 --> 42:22.440
will be borne by me alone.

42:22.440 --> 42:23.552
My only wish is for you

42:23.670 --> 42:25.030
to ascend the throne.

42:30.630 --> 42:31.760
I have heard

42:33.710 --> 42:34.840
everything you've all said.

42:35.552 --> 42:37.800
For all these years,
you have served our Rong family

42:38.150 --> 42:39.400
tirelessly.

42:41.190 --> 42:42.400
Your loyalty

42:43.680 --> 42:45.150
is something I will never forget.

42:45.400 --> 42:46.710
You are wise, Your Highness.

42:47.360 --> 42:48.190
However,

42:50.670 --> 42:52.000
I will not kill

42:53.960 --> 42:55.320
Shen Xihe.

42:57.920 --> 42:59.280
In fact,

43:03.840 --> 43:05.800
she will become my princess consort.

43:07.510 --> 43:08.070
This...

43:11.840 --> 43:13.480
How can this be?

43:27.088 --> 43:29.960
It's been a while since the East Palace
guards have been replaced, right?

43:29.960 --> 43:31.280
What exactly are you trying to do?

43:31.344 --> 43:33.310
I want to be the father
of the child in your womb.

43:33.320 --> 43:34.630
You're insane.

43:34.710 --> 43:36.710
Now that I can have the entire world,

43:36.840 --> 43:38.230
is there anything I can't have?

43:38.710 --> 43:39.360
Changqing,

43:39.480 --> 43:40.670
what on earth are you doing?

43:40.760 --> 43:42.400
I'm going to marry Shen Xihe.

43:42.528 --> 43:44.896
I will give her the best of everything
in this world.

43:49.831 --> 43:52.771
♪I've hidden so many words♪

43:53.391 --> 43:56.191
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

43:57.061 --> 44:04.031
♪So never uncover♪

44:04.221 --> 44:06.581
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

44:07.711 --> 44:10.441
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

44:11.401 --> 44:16.741
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

44:18.501 --> 44:21.321
♪Every answer I gave♪

44:22.121 --> 44:24.971
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

44:25.761 --> 44:29.131
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

44:29.391 --> 44:32.701
♪How hard it truly was?♪

44:35.671 --> 44:39.111
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

44:40.101 --> 44:42.431
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

44:43.701 --> 44:49.461
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

44:50.871 --> 44:54.001
♪It's a shame I never could♪

44:54.451 --> 44:57.461
♪Give you a moon in return♪

44:57.571 --> 45:04.211
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

45:04.211 --> 45:07.881
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

45:08.751 --> 45:11.511
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

45:11.951 --> 45:15.081
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

45:15.521 --> 45:21.471
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

45:22.871 --> 45:26.421
♪You'll never♪

45:26.701 --> 45:36.171
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

46:02.341 --> 46:05.821
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
